  grh-ln "      <h3><span class='ep' data-pure='Exact Codimension-1 Pairing of Definite &amp; Indefinite Lift Towers' data-wb='Alp&ouml;ge&ndash;Sernau 11-Space Unitary Hermitian Seesaw &amp; m&sup2;-Turn Rallis Commutative Square'>Exact Codimension-1 Pairing of Definite &amp; Indefinite Lift Towers</span></h3>" (
  grh-ln "      <p>To transport height-2 jet divisibility (Node 05, living on definite spaces) onto spectral cusp forms (Node 04, living on indefinite spaces), run two parallel <span class='m'><i>m</i></span>-step <span class='ep' data-pure='conjugate-symmetric unitary lift towers' data-wb='unitary Kudla&ndash;Rallis theta towers'>conjugate-symmetric unitary lift towers</span>: an upper definite chain <span class='m'><i>X</i><sub>0</sub> &rarr; &cdots; &rarr; <i>X</i><sub><i>m</i></sub></span> starting at rank <span class='m'><i>k</i></span> (adding <span class='m'><i>t</i>+1</span> per step) and a lower indefinite chain <span class='m'><i>Y</i><sub>0</sub> &rarr; &cdots; &rarr; <i>Y</i><sub><i>m</i></sub></span> starting at rank <span class='m'><i>r</i> = <i>k</i> + <i>m</i> &minus; 1</span> (adding <span class='m'><i>t</i> = 5<i>r</i></span> per step).</p>" (
  grh-ln "      <p>In the polynomial ring <span class='m'>&Zopf;[<i>k</i>, &varrho;, <i>j</i>]</span>, all quadratic products <span class='m'><i>m</i>&middot;<i>t</i></span> cancel identically at the top of the tower, leaving <span class='m'>rank(<i>X</i><sub><i>m</i></sub>) &minus; rank(<i>Y</i><sub><i>m</i></sub>) &equiv; 1</span> universally: <span class='m'><i>Y</i><sub><i>m</i></sub> &sub; <i>X</i><sub><i>m</i></sub></span> is an exact codimension-1 sublattice, so kernel transpose adjunction (Node 08) restricts forms across the two towers with zero rank gap.</p>" (
