  grh-ln "      <p>Assemble the <span class='m'><i>d</i> &times; <i>d</i></span> evaluation matrix of tower-lifted forms (Nodes 08&ndash;10) at spherical progression-free columns (Node 06) differentiated via height-2 formal-group jets (Node 05). Mediant slope convexity (Node 07) sandwiches its logarithmic determinant between an <span class='ep' data-pure='upper jet-valuation slope bound' data-wb='Bost TwistedLattice upper slope bound'>upper jet-valuation slope bound</span> and a <span class='ep' data-pure='lower integrality and field-automorphism ramification bound' data-wb='Shimura&ndash;Ribet&ndash;Kisin&ndash;Kummer Selmer determinant floor'>lower integrality and field-automorphism ramification bound</span>.</p>" (
