  grh-ln "        <textarea class='code-ed' id='ed-11' spellcheck='false'>sandwich-annihilates : Word → Word → Word → Word → Word → Word → Word → Word → Bool&#10;sandwich-annihilates d m k u rem l x99 b = let hmain = %wmul (%wmul m k) u in let upper = %wadd (%wmul d (%wadd (%wsub hmain (%wmul m rem)) l)) (%wadd (%wmul #4 (%wmul d x99)) (%wmul #10 (%wmul d b))) in let lower = %wmul d (%wsub hmain (%wmul #3 l)) in let residual = %wmul d (%wsub (%wadd (%wmul #4 l) (%wadd (%wmul #4 x99) (%wmul #10 b))) (%wmul m rem)) in %weq (%wsub upper lower) residual&#10;period-modulus-cancels : Word → Word → Word → Word → Bool&#10;period-modulus-cancels s mw mper alg = rz-eq (rz-add (rz-add (rz-sub (rz true s) (rz-add (rz true mw) (rz-add (rz true mper) (rz true alg)))) (rz true alg)) (rz true mper)) (rz-sub (rz true s) (rz true mw))&#10;thm-determinant-annihilation : andB (rz-all-upto #20 (λ k → rz-all-upto #20 (λ u → sandwich-annihilates #7 #8 k (%wmul u #997) #3 #11 #13 #17))) (period-modulus-cancels #100000 #25000 #8888 #3333) ≡ true&#10;thm-determinant-annihilation = refl</textarea>" (
